      ],
      "SPECIAL ABILITIES": [
        "Evasion (Ex)",
        "A golden cactuar can avoid even magical and unusual attacks with great agility. If the golden cactuar makes a successful Reflex saving throw against an attack that normally deals half damage on a successful save, it instead takes no damage. A helpless golden cactuar does not gain the benefit of evasion.",
        "Resistant (Ex)",
        "A golden cactuar is unusually resistant to everything, gaining a +5 resistance bonus to all saving throws.",
        "Thorns (Ex)",
        "A golden cactuar's body is covered with sharp metal thorns. Any creature attacking a golden cactuar with a non-reach melee weapon or with natural attacks takes 1d4+4 points of piercing damage from the golden cactuar's sharp thorns. A creature that grapples with a golden cactuar takes this same damage each round.",
        "Three Thousand Needles (Su)",
        "3/day, a golden cactuar may conjure up a spray of needles and fires them at targets in a 30-ft.-cone. Creatures within the area take 10d4 points of piercing damage (Reflex save DC 16 for half damage)."
      ],
